  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CADESA Local Processing Support &#x2013; Agriterra</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the support project is to strengthen the governance, management, and operational capabilities of CADESA COOP-CA, ensuring the successful establishment of a sustainable, small-scale cocoa processing unit. Through technical assistance, provided by Agriterra, this project focuses on governance improvement and digitalisation regarding (financial) traceability.Phase 1 (2025), which is covered in this project, emphasises setting up governance structures, enhancing financial and physical (digital) traceability.The cooperative&apos;s processing unit will serve as a model for scaling similar initiatives, contributing to the Ivorian government&apos;s goal of processing 100% of cocoa domestically by 2030.This initiative complements the CocoaTechD&apos;Ivoire Impact Cluster, which seeks to transform the cocoa sector by improving local processing, increasing value retention, and promoting circular and inclusive business models.</narrative>
  </description>
